[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:How do you do?]
[00:00.74]Lesson 17 | 第17课
[00:02.54]How do you do? | 你好！
[00:05.43]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.74]What are Michael Baker and Jeremy Short's jobs? | 迈克尔·贝克和杰里米·肖特的职业是什么？
[00:18.60]Come and meet our employees Mr.Richards. | 理查兹先生，来见见我们的员工。
[00:24.52]Thank you Mr. Jackson. | 谢谢你，杰克逊先生。
[00:27.87]This is Nicola Grey | 这是尼古拉·格雷
[00:31.09]and this is Claire Taylor. | 这是克莱尔·泰勒。
[00:34.68]How do you do? | 你好！
[00:37.58]Those women are very hard-working. | 那些女士们非常勤奋。
[00:42.43]What are their jobs? | 她们的职业是什么？
[00:45.76]They're keyboard operators. | 她们是键盘操作员。
[00:50.10]This is Michael Baker | 这是迈克尔·贝克
[00:53.53]and this is Jeremy Short. | 这是杰里米·肖特。
[00:57.02]How do you do? | 你好！
[00:59.88]They aren't very busy! | 他们不太忙！
[01:03.34]What are their jobs? | 他们的职业是什么？
[01:07.00]They're sales reps. | 他们是销售代表。
[01:09.93]They're very lazy. | 他们很懒惰。
[01:12.72]Who is this young man? | 这个年轻人是谁？
[01:16.28]This is Jim. | 这是吉姆。
[01:19.08]He's our office assistant. | 他是我们的办公室助理。